{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Pasang, cuxan ga ryax hngawan, mosa su inu?",
                "textCh": "Pasang，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918437",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "cami Yageh ga mosa myan cmuling syang beh syaw gong, isu ga?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Yageh去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918438",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "pungan ke su ga myasa calay! ana caku mluw cimu mosa?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918439",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "kayan yaya gleng ha!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918440",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "yaya, ana cu mluw suyan mlikuy mosa beh syaw gong?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918441",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ana, ana ga pnba lungan mamu ki!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918442",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "iya nkux, pnba cami calay!",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65663/918443",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
